     Peppol BIS Buyer Managed Ordering 3.0
     Scenario 3 - Cancellation of order from buyer. Document 3 of 3.

     The buyer cancels the order in full, before the deadline agreed in the contract.
     To remove single lines the buyer would send an order change with line status code 2
     instead. Any order change arriving after this cancellation is discarded by the seller.
-->
